images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cosmic Omen: Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen:_Ability_Check_(Condition)\" title=\"Cosmic Omen: Ability Check (Condition)\">Cosmic Omen: Ability Check</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Gains a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/27px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/41px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/54px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/27px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>+1d6</b> bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted by using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen\" title=\"Cosmic Omen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/25px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/38px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/50px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cosmic Omen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/25px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen\" title=\"Cosmic Omen\">Cosmic Omen</a> during a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Shares the same icon as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guidance\" title=\"Guidance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/25px-Guidance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/38px-Guidance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/50px-Guidance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guidance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/25px-Guidance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guidance\" title=\"Guidance\">Guidance</a>. However, both bonuses stack.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043216\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2669/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32773/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11877/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1120223/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n106.21%   61.376     31 Template:Trim\n100.00%   57.787      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   57.787      1 -total\n 19.40%   11.208      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 15.78%    9.117      1 Template:Condition\n 15.21%    8.788      5 Template:Icon_text\n 13.66%    7.893      1 Template:Resource\n 10.88%    6.286      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.83%    6.261      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.80%    6.241      4 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:48994-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715043216 and revision id 293297. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n 